{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "process-nox-speciation fixture",
    "description": "The `process-nox-speciation` fixture: the run's EXECUTION database -- the snapshot's own tables, cut from the default database for this RunSpec and holding its generators' intermediate tables -- mounted on `onroad/model.esm`. It holds no logic: its `data_sources` are the catalogue under the names the model reads, and its one model, `Fixture`, mounts the domain model as a SUBSYSTEM, binds the run's declared counts, and carries the run's inline tests: assertions on the mounted model's intermediate values (`Onroad.*` / `Nonroad.*`) against this snapshot. A test written inside a `{ref}`'d model does not run (finding F47), so the assertions live here, in the document that supplies the data they are about (esm-spec §6.6; conventions §106). run-tests.sh's fixture stage runs them, then emits the model's `out_*` relation and compares it with the snapshot's MOVESOutput. `runspecs/process-nox-speciation.esm` reproduces the same run from the DEFAULT database through the same model, so the pair is a differential test of the execution-database cut: one model, one oracle, two catalogues.\n\nUntil 2026-10-30 this file inlined its own copy of the onroad model (18621 lines, frozen at the commit that last touched it), so the logic every fixture shared was written fourteen times. PLAN.md §7.1, docs/esm-conventions.md §106."
  },
  "models": {
    "Fixture": {
      "subsystems": {
        "Onroad": {
          "ref": "catalogues/onroad-execution-db.esm",
          "url_substitutions": {
            "snapshot": "process-nox-speciation"
          },
          "bindings": {
            "n_outputRate": 436
          }
        }
      },
      "variables": {},
      "equations": [],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "the_run_scope_comes_from_the_execution_database",
          "description": "Year 2020, August, hour 7, road type 4, county 26161, zone 261610. The RunSpec XML says month 7 and hour 6; the execution database says 8 and 7, and it is the authority (docs/mixed-onroad.md 0.1). The last four rows are what this fixture adds to that list: at 59.5 degF the hour also carries 10.0536843 g/kg of specific humidity and a 0.0159290590 water mole fraction, and the county carries a GPA fraction of 0 -- the humidity pair drives the whole NOx temperature factor and the GPA fraction selects which arm of every fuel effect applies.\n\nTHE TWO HUMIDITY ROWS FACE THE REFERENCE ACROSS THIS DOCUMENT'S OWN ARITHMETIC (docs/esm-conventions.md 35.4). Their `expected` is what `ZoneMonthHour` STORES; since docs/meteorology-generator.md 8.2 the value under test is not that column but MG-4 to MG-7 run here from `temperature`, `relHumidity` and `County.barometricPressure`. Measured, the port lands 10.053684062398 against the stored 10.053684293477 (2.2985e-08 relative) and 0.015929058669 against 0.015929059029 (2.2619e-08). Those two rows therefore carry `rel: 1e-7` -- four times the worse of the pair, the same gate components/meteorology.esm asserts the whole generator at, and 200x tighter than tolerance.toml's per-cell 2e-05. The other fifteen rows are keys and stay at the test's exact 1e-09.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "tolerance": {
            "rel": 1e-09
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_yearID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 2020.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecyear_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_monthID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 8.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecmonth_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rsd_hourID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 7.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecday_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_roadTypeID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 4.0,
              "coords": {
                "run_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.run_countyID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 26161.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspeccounty_rows": 1
              }
            },
