        {
          "id": "the_four_pollutant_processes_and_the_three_chains",
          "description": "The run's whole pollutant scope, unpacked from `runspecpollutantprocess` and `runspecchainedto` rather than written down. 301 is Oxides of Nitrogen x Running Exhaust and is the only one with rates of its own; 3201, 3301 and 3401 are NO, NO2 and HONO on the same process and each is chained from 301 (the chain edges are not asserted here: the per-row chain-input variable is gone, replaced by the `lnk_*` edge list). `calculator-dag.json` splits them between two Java classes -- `NOCalculator` registers (32, 1) and (34, 1), `NO2Calculator` registers (33, 1) -- and the split is invisible here on purpose: both classes' SQL 'Processing' sections are the same two joins and the same multiply, so one chain expression serves all three. None of the four is an energy pollutant, so every unit divisor is exactly 1 and `baserateunits` says `g` four times.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 3.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 32.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 33.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_pollutantID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 34.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 4
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_processID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_processID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Onroad.rspp_processID",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 3
              }
